This folder is made up of the code and workspaces that were used in an earlier form of the data analysis. 

Urban to Local.R was used when we were comparing all of the different urban greenspace habitats to each other. (oldest version of this analysis)

The file ComparingLocal.R was created when we began compating the two studies we were using then separately, (Sivakoff et al  and Turo et al.) BUT we were still doing analyses of the bee communities based on landscape variables.

The multiple versions of the LocalModels.GLMSONLY (with essentially the same name) are likely results of user eror. They were created for running the GLMS when we were only using two studeis and were still using landscae data. Caralee S. was attempting to learn how to use r notebook and R markdown. These codes were written around the same time as the file ComparingLocal.R.

The code was modified and reused in later iterations of our analysis found in the main folder


